sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player as Web Browser JS (MediaPipe)
    participant APIGW as API Gateway REST API
    participant Lambda as Monolithic Lambda (Server)
    participant BedrockRuntime as Bedrock AgentCore Runtime
    participant AgentContainer as Commentator Container (Strands)
    participant ToolGateway as Bedrock AgentCore Tool Gateway
    participant ToolLambda as Downstream Tool Lambda
    participant IoTCore as AWS IoT Core (MQTT)
    participant Robot as Physical Robot / Simulator

    %% Step 1: Gesture recognized in JS, calling Server
    Player->>Player: Track 21 hand landmarks on-device
    Note over Player: Recognize "Malevolent Shrine" gesture
    Player->>APIGW: HTTP POST /api/trigger-technique (Cognito Bearer JWT)
    
    %% Step 2: API Gateway to Lambda Server
    Note over APIGW: Validate Cognito JWT at cloud edge
    APIGW->>Lambda: Forward payload to Flask Lambda Backend
    
    %% Step 3: Server Orchestration & Runtime Invocation
    Note over Lambda: Parse JJK_ACTION_MAP<br/>1. Trigger physical action<br/>2. Retrieve pre-match webcam photos
    Lambda->>Robot: Make direct async REST call to stance controller
    Note over Lambda: Embed webcam photos inside prompt<br/>using <p1_webcam_base64_jpeg> tags
    Lambda->>BedrockRuntime: invoke_agent_runtime(agentRuntimeArn, payload_dict)

    %% Step 4: AgentCore Runtime Container Execution
    Note over BedrockRuntime: Route payload via IAM SigV4
    BedrockRuntime->>AgentContainer: HTTP POST /invocations to ARM64 Container
    Note over AgentContainer: regex_extract base64 from XML tags<br/>Convert to Bedrock binary multimodal parts
    AgentContainer->>AgentContainer: Execute Strands Agent logic wrapping Bedrock model
   
    %% Step 5: Model Tool Call / Query Routing
    Note over AgentContainer: Model decides to execute a tool<br/>(e.g., query robot battery/state tool)
    AgentContainer->>BedrockRuntime: propagate tool_call JSON-RPC
    BedrockRuntime->>ToolGateway: Route SigV4-signed tool_call

    %% Step 6: Tool Gateway to Downstream Target
    Note over ToolGateway: Validate IAM permissions &<br/>resolve name: target___tool_name
    ToolGateway->>ToolLambda: Invoke Downstream Target Lambda
    Note over ToolLambda: Strip target prefix<br/>Publish posture state to IoT
    ToolLambda->>IoTCore: iot:Publish (robot_1/topic)
    IoTCore-->>Robot: MQTT Command Delivery
    ToolLambda-->>ToolGateway: Return execution output payload
    ToolGateway-->>BedrockRuntime: Return tool output
    BedrockRuntime-->>AgentContainer: Feed tool result back to model
    Note over AgentContainer: Model completes sassy narration

    %% Step 7: Response & Speech Delivery
    AgentContainer-->>BedrockRuntime: HTTP 200 {"response": "...sassy text..."}
    BedrockRuntime-->>Lambda: Return response payload
    Note over Lambda: 1. Clean Markdown formatting using BeautifulSoup<br/>2. Call AWS Polly SynthesizeSpeech (Neural Cantonese)<br/>3. Upload audio to S3 & generate presigned URL
    Lambda-->>APIGW: Return HTTP 200 {"text": "...", "audioUrl": "..."}
    APIGW-->>Player: Return JSON payload
    Player->>Player: Play high-fidelity neural audio commentary!
